class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>nothri</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/259118-abandoned-by-disney?p=259134#post259134\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The stories just felt particularly suited to Changeling style horror, ya know?</div> </div> </div> </div>There are 2 more I believe. I actually love these stories and use a lot of CP for various story hooks<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1250-shadowlost","name":"Shadowlost","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1250_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"155"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-09T10:52:17-07:00","id":276488,"title":"","content":"I ran two chronicles in my own setting for Orlando. Having lived in the city for a decade I drew on my experience of the Attractions a lot. Some notes to help the discussion.<br /> <br /> The CIty really is divided by the Area of the Attractions and the rest of the city. Orlando is a 'new' municipality. We lack the older infrustrutruction seen in most other large cities. All high rises were built in the last 30 years and the alleys are all very wide. During the hay day of Florida Summer Resorts (1915-1929) it was nothing but a junction stop on a rail line between Daytona and Tampa. During the Depression these Resorts all died out for the most part. It was a bad time in Central Florida economically. As the US entered WWII The ports of the state saw a lot of attention as supplies and troops were sent to Africa and Europe. Orlando became important as a junctiion again and saw some military development. A Explosives tech firm moved into the city becuase of it's central location.<br /> THe Biggest thing would be Disney' interest. Central FLorida was dotted with small, struggling resorts at this point. New infrastructure meant more access for tourists and Disney saw an opportunity. As WDW grew, so did Nearby Orlando. New professionals from California wanted the trappings of their robust state. UCF was built by one such visionary. THe Predominance of Orange Grooves began to die. Though in the outskurts of the Municipality, Vast green houses and Citrus Grooves are still very common.<br /> <br /> I'll post again with specifics of what I did with the region in the WoD. I hope this helps.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4036-khalvin8","name":"Khalvin8","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4036_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"48"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-09T13:52:08-07:00","id":276614,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Shadowlost</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/259118-abandoned-by-disney?p=265202#post265202\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> There are 2 more I believe. I actually love these stories and use a lot of CP for various story hooks</div> </div> </div> </div>Am I the only one who finds CP fairly hilarious? Most of it is really bad at evoking actual feeling of, you know, <i>fear</i>. I mean, it's a starting point, granted, but they just turn out hilarious once the person throws in &quot;I never recovered the photos&quot; (then what are we looking at?) or &quot;80' python&quot; (Are you <i>sure</i> they grow that big? Really?).<br /> <br /> There's no real... <i>craft</i> to it.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I have decided, after some thought, that I don't really feel happy on these forums. I might decide to come back to post. Who knows - but right now, I'm gone.<br /> <br /> So good bye, good luck, and have a nice day.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1170-amechra","name":"amechra","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1170_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2316"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-09T16:32:09-07:00","id":276770,"title":"","content":"Creepypasta varies from fairly good to terrible. Looking at the pool of writers, they vary from actual writers to middle school kids. So there is a wide net. There are still a few I enjoy. Candle Cove is a big winner for me.<br /> <br /> That said, &quot;Then Who Was Phone?&quot; is an excellent parody, whether it was written originally as one or not.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/OnyxGraphics/OnyxMod.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Onyx Path Moderator </span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\">Forum Rules</a><br /> <span style=\"color:#FF0000\">This is my mod voice.</span> This is my goth voice.<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/geist-the-sin-eaters/15731-geist-balance-of-shadows-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\">[Geist: Balance of Shadows</a><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/17537-v20-the-conspiracy-of-hrad-%C4%8Dern%C3%A1-hora-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\"> ][ Vampire: The Conspiracy of Hrad \u010cern\u00e1 Hora</a><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/13838-scion-bohemian-front-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\"> ][ Scion: Bohemian Front</a>][<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/99033-changeling-malibu-dream-house-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\">Changeling: Malibu Dream House</a>] [<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/268069-demon-night-train-detective-agency-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\">Demon: Night Train Detective Agency</a>] <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/la94fvk\" target=\"_blank\">[WoD: The Golden Eagle</a>]","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/56-baroness-nerak","name":"Baroness Nerak","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar56_2.jpeg","title":"Moderator","rank":6,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2524"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-09T20:21:27-07:00","id":276945,"title":"","content":"Funnily enough I found the story to be best for Hunter based stories, with some ties to Changeling, Geist, and Demon for weaving set pieces and atmosphere.<br /> <br /> But the idea I'm spinning from it is interesting-I think I'll try pitching it to my group after this semester's round.","signatu